YAHAN roz ki nayi HTML file daalo.

Naam ka format (koi bhi chalega):
  07-10-2026.html     (DD-MM-YYYY)  <-- recommended
  2026-10-07.html     (YYYY-MM-DD)
  7 oct.html          (saal na ho to site.config.json ka defaultYear lagega)

Jis file ka naam _ se shuru ho (jaise _draft.html) wo website par nahi dikhegi.
